    <profile name="All is Dust" id="b0f4-681f-f44d-27e9" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an attack with a damage characteristic of 1 is allocated to a model in this unit, add 1 to any armour saving throw made against that attack. In addition, models in this unit do not suffer the penalty to hit rolls incurred for firing Heavy weapons in the same turn that their unit has moved.</characteristic>
