                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">If manifested, the closest visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of the psyker suffers D6 mortal wounds. If the result of the Psychic test was more than 11 the target suffers 3D3 mortal wounds instead.</characteristic>
