          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem before the battle. Select a THOUSAND SONS VEHICLE from your army and select a combi-bolter, combi-melta, combi-flamer, heavy bolter or twin heavy bolter that the model is equipped with. That weapon is upgraded to fire inferno bolt rounds. Change the AP characteristic of that weapon to -2 (only  change the boltgun profile for a combi-melta or combi-flamer).</characteristic>
