          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In each of your Command phases, if the bearer is on the battlefield, it can read from the Perfidious Tome. If it does,  roll one D6; on a 1, your opponent gains 1 Command Point. On a 4+, you gain 1 Command Point.</characteristic>
