          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, in your Command phase, you can select the bearer or one friendly THOUSAND SONS INFANTRY unit within 6&quot; of the bearer and remove it from the battlefield, In the Reinforcement step of that turn&apos;s Movement phase, set up that unit anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models.</characteristic>
