                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">18&quot;</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: If manifested, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; and visible to this PSYKER and roll nine D6. For each roll of 6, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound. If the result of the Psychic test was an unmodified 9+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound for each roll of 5+ instead.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
