              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a melee attack is made by this WARLORD, an unmodified hit roll of 6 inflicts 1 mortal wound on the target in addition to any other damage.</characteristic>
