                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whilst they are within 3&quot; of this WARLORD, friendly CULT OF SCHEMING units gain the Objective Secured ability. If they already have the Objective Secured ability, each model in that unit counts as two models for the purposes of determining who controls objective markers.</characteristic>
